{"$defs":{"AdapterIdentity":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A pinned adapter name and version, plan section 3.5.","properties":{"adapter_name":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NormalizedIdentifier"},"adapter_version":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"}},"required":["adapter_name","adapter_version"],"title":"AdapterIdentity","type":"object"},"ApproximationId":{"pattern":"^appx_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"AssetCode":{"maxLength":32,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Z][A-Z0-9]*(?:[._-][A-Z0-9]+)*(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"AttemptToken":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":32,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"BarOrderPriority":{"description":"Plan section 3.5: the order in which one bar's exits and entries apply.","enum":["EXITS_BEFORE_ENTRIES","ENTRIES_BEFORE_EXITS"],"title":"BarOrderPriority","type":"string"},"CalendarValidUtcDateTime":{"allOf":[{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(?:\\.[0-9]{6})?Z(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},{"pattern":"^(?:(?:[0-9]{3}[1-9]|[0-9]{2}[1-9][0-9]|[0-9][1-9][0-9]{2}|[1-9][0-9]{3})-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|30)|02-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-9]|2[0-8]))|(?:[0-9]{2}(?:0[48]|[2468][048]|[13579][26])|(?:0[48]|[2468][048]|[13579][26])00)-02-29)T","type":"string"},{"pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T(?:[01][0-9]|2[0-3]):[0-5][0-9]:[0-5][0-9](?:\\.[0-9]{6})?Z","type":"string"}]},"CanonicalDecimal":{"description":"Canonical finite Decimal string","maxLength":256,"pattern":"^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*(?:\\.[0-9]*[1-9])?|0\\.[0-9]*[1-9]|-[1-9][0-9]*(?:\\.[0-9]*[1-9])?|-0\\.[0-9]*[1-9])(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"CommandKind":{"description":"Specification section 14.1: the three adapter commands.","enum":["DESCRIBE","VALIDATE","RUN"],"title":"CommandKind","type":"string"},"ComparisonLevel":{"description":"Specification sections 25.1 to 25.3.\n\nLevel 2 requires Level 1, and Level 3 does not expect numerically identical\nresults. Member values sort in numeric order, so a sorted collection is also\ncanonically ordered.","enum":["LEVEL_1","LEVEL_2","LEVEL_3"],"title":"ComparisonLevel","type":"string"},"DescribeRequestPayload":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The token-free ``describe`` payload (plan 3.6; specification 14.2, 14.3).\n\n``bootstrap_schema_version`` first, per the fixed bootstrap fields of\nspecification 14.2; then the catalog identity the core expects the adapter\nto describe and the versions the core supports, each collection bounded,\nunique and numerically sorted. Vocabulary versions sort by the integer after\n``capabilities/v`` -- the plan 3.8 and 5.3 rule, applied here as the declared\nreading of plan 3.6's \"sorted unique\" so the describe, bootstrap and\nnegotiation collections share one order.","properties":{"adapter_name":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NormalizedIdentifier"},"adapter_version":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"},"bootstrap_schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Bootstrap Schema Version","type":"string"},"core_capability_vocabulary_versions":{"items":{"maxLength":32,"pattern":"^capabilities/v[1-9][0-9]*(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":1,"title":"Core Capability Vocabulary Versions","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"core_supported_protocol_versions":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"},"maxItems":32,"minItems":1,"title":"Core Supported Protocol Versions","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"core_supported_schema_versions":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},"maxItems":128,"minItems":1,"title":"Core Supported Schema Versions","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"executable_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"}},"required":["bootstrap_schema_version","adapter_name","adapter_version","executable_hash","core_supported_protocol_versions","core_supported_schema_versions","core_capability_vocabulary_versions"],"title":"DescribeRequestPayload","type":"object"},"EngineIdentity":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A pinned engine name and version, plan section 3.5.","properties":{"engine_name":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NormalizedIdentifier"},"engine_version":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"}},"required":["engine_name","engine_version"],"title":"EngineIdentity","type":"object"},"EngineRunRequest":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The temporary immutable adapter payload for one attempt (plan 3.6).\n\nSpecification 11.3's row in order, plus the pinned ``negotiated_versions``\nand the two provenance hashes the manifest must echo. Trust class W and\ntoken-bearing: never persisted or finalized; its authoritative snapshot is\n``SanitizedEngineRunRequest``. The token is hidden from ``repr``.","properties":{"adapter":{"$ref":"#/$defs/AdapterIdentity"},"assigned_work_dir":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WorkDirectoryReference"},"attempt_number":{"maximum":5,"minimum":1,"title":"Attempt Number","type":"integer"},"attempt_token":{"$ref":"#/$defs/AttemptToken"},"comparison_level":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ComparisonLevel"},"configuration_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"configuration_snapshot":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RunConfigurationSnapshot"},"created_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime"},"dataset_version_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"engine":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EngineIdentity"},"experiment_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ExperimentId"},"experiment_spec_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"logical_slot_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/LogicalSlotId"},"negotiated_versions":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NegotiatedVersions"},"protocol_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Protocol Version","type":"string"},"request_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"request_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RequestId"},"run_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RunId"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"},"strategy_version_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"}},"required":["schema_version","protocol_version","request_id","experiment_id","run_id","logical_slot_id","attempt_number","attempt_token","strategy_version_hash","dataset_version_hash","adapter","engine","configuration_snapshot","configuration_hash","comparison_level","negotiated_versions","assigned_work_dir","experiment_spec_hash","request_hash","created_at_utc"],"title":"EngineRunRequest","type":"object"},"ExecutionAssumptions":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Level 2 execution and rounding assumptions, plan section 3.5.\n\nPrices and quantities are quantized only when sizing intent becomes an order\nintent (specification 12.3.2), using these precisions and the fixed rounding.","properties":{"bar_order_priority":{"$ref":"#/$defs/BarOrderPriority"},"fill_convention":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FillConvention"},"price_precision":{"maximum":18,"minimum":0,"title":"Price Precision","type":"integer"},"quantity_precision":{"maximum":18,"minimum":0,"title":"Quantity Precision","type":"integer"},"rounding_mode":{"const":"ROUND_HALF_EVEN","title":"Rounding Mode","type":"string"},"signal_to_order_timing":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SignalToOrderTiming"}},"required":["signal_to_order_timing","bar_order_priority","fill_convention","price_precision","quantity_precision","rounding_mode"],"title":"ExecutionAssumptions","type":"object"},"ExperimentId":{"pattern":"^exp_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"FeeAssumptions":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Maker and taker fee rates, each a non-negative rate of at most one.","properties":{"maker_fee_rate":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NonNegativeDecimal"},"taker_fee_rate":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NonNegativeDecimal"}},"required":["maker_fee_rate","taker_fee_rate"],"title":"FeeAssumptions","type":"object"},"FillConvention":{"description":"Plan section 3.5: whether an order intent fills whole or may fill partially.","enum":["FULL_FILL","PARTIAL_FILLS_ALLOWED"],"title":"FillConvention","type":"string"},"InvocationId":{"pattern":"^inv_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"LogicalSlotId":{"pattern":"^slot_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"Money":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CanonicalDecimal"},"currency":{"$ref":"#/$defs/AssetCode"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"}},"required":["schema_version","currency","amount"],"title":"Money","type":"object"},"NegotiatedVersions":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The versions negotiation chose, pinned in the request (plan 3.6, 5.2).\n\nSpecification 14.2: \"chosen versions are pinned in the request\". Exactly the\nfive negotiable schema names, once each, sorted (published exactly as\n``prefixItems`` by ``_negotiated_schema_extra``); the protocol version is the\nsingle literal the core supports. The per-name ``schema_version`` values are\ndeliberately constrained only as ``SemanticVersion``: they are negotiation's\nselection (Task 3) from the adapter's declared lists, not a rule of this\nrecord. A nested value object.","properties":{"capability_vocabulary_version":{"maxLength":32,"pattern":"^capabilities/v[1-9][0-9]*(?![\\s\\S])","title":"Capability Vocabulary Version","type":"string"},"protocol_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Protocol Version","type":"string"},"schema_versions":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},"maxItems":5,"minItems":5,"prefixItems":[{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},{"properties":{"schema_name":{"const":"protocol.adapter-command-request-envelope"}},"required":["schema_name"]}]},{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},{"properties":{"schema_name":{"const":"protocol.adapter-descriptor"}},"required":["schema_name"]}]},{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},{"properties":{"schema_name":{"const":"protocol.adapter-result-manifest"}},"required":["schema_name"]}]},{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},{"properties":{"schema_name":{"const":"protocol.adapter-validation-result"}},"required":["schema_name"]}]},{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SupportedSchemaVersion"},{"properties":{"schema_name":{"const":"protocol.protocol-event-envelope"}},"required":["schema_name"]}]}],"title":"Schema Versions","type":"array","uniqueItems":true}},"required":["protocol_version","schema_versions","capability_vocabulary_version"],"title":"NegotiatedVersions","type":"object"},"NonNegativeDecimal":{"description":"Canonical non-negative Decimal string","maxLength":256,"pattern":"^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*(?:\\.[0-9]*[1-9])?|0\\.[0-9]*[1-9])(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"NormalizedIdentifier":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(?:[._-][a-z0-9]+)*(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"ProtocolLimits":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The protocol limits snapshotted into one request (plan section 3.2).\n\nA nested value object: no envelope version, every field required, every\nbound the corresponding configuration bound. The missing-heartbeat threshold\nmust be at least twice the heartbeat interval (``ProcessConfig`` rule).","properties":{"heartbeat_interval_seconds":{"maximum":300,"minimum":1,"title":"Heartbeat Interval Seconds","type":"integer"},"max_event_bytes":{"maximum":1048576,"minimum":4096,"title":"Max Event Bytes","type":"integer"},"max_manifest_bytes":{"maximum":16777216,"minimum":65536,"title":"Max Manifest Bytes","type":"integer"},"max_stderr_bytes":{"maximum":52428800,"minimum":1048576,"title":"Max Stderr Bytes","type":"integer"},"missing_heartbeat_seconds":{"maximum":900,"minimum":2,"title":"Missing Heartbeat Seconds","type":"integer"}},"required":["max_event_bytes","max_manifest_bytes","max_stderr_bytes","heartbeat_interval_seconds","missing_heartbeat_seconds"],"title":"ProtocolLimits","type":"object"},"RelativeCandidatePath":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!(?:[Aa][Uu][Xx]|[Cc][Oo][Nn]|[Nn][Uu][Ll]|[Pp][Rr][Nn]|[Cc][Oo][Mm][1-9]|[Ll][Pp][Tt][1-9])(?:\\.|/|(?![\\s\\S])))[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,253}[A-Za-z0-9_-])?(?:/(?!(?:[Aa][Uu][Xx]|[Cc][Oo][Nn]|[Nn][Uu][Ll]|[Pp][Rr][Nn]|[Cc][Oo][Mm][1-9]|[Ll][Pp][Tt][1-9])(?:\\.|/|(?![\\s\\S])))[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,253}[A-Za-z0-9_-])?){0,31}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"RequestId":{"pattern":"^req_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"RunConfigurationSnapshot":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The material assumptions and protocol limits the adapter needs (plan 3.6).\n\nCopied from the frozen ``ExperimentSpec``, the frozen slot compatibility\n(``approximation_ids``, so the adapter can echo them in its manifest) and the\nqueued configuration (``limits``). The declared reading of specification\n11.3 ``configuration_snapshot``, 13.4 and 15.3. A nested value object.","properties":{"approximation_ids":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ApproximationId"},"maxItems":64,"title":"Approximation Ids","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"comparison_level":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ComparisonLevel"},"execution_assumptions":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ExecutionAssumptions"},"fee_assumptions":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FeeAssumptions"},"limits":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ProtocolLimits"},"slippage_assumptions":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SlippageAssumptions"},"starting_balance":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Money"}},"required":["starting_balance","fee_assumptions","slippage_assumptions","execution_assumptions","comparison_level","approximation_ids","limits"],"title":"RunConfigurationSnapshot","type":"object"},"RunId":{"pattern":"^run_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"SemanticVersion":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":5,"pattern":"^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"Sha256":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"SignalToOrderTiming":{"description":"Plan section 3.5: when a bar-close signal becomes an order intent.","enum":["NEXT_BAR_OPEN","SAME_BAR_CLOSE"],"title":"SignalToOrderTiming","type":"string"},"SlippageAssumptions":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A slippage model and its basis points, present exactly under the fixed model.","properties":{"basis_points":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NonNegativeDecimal","title":"Basis Points"},"model":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SlippageModel"}},"required":["model"],"title":"SlippageAssumptions","type":"object"},"SlippageModel":{"description":"Plan section 3.5: the Project 1 slippage vocabulary, extended additively.","enum":["NONE","FIXED_BASIS_POINTS"],"title":"SlippageModel","type":"string"},"SupportedSchemaVersion":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"schema_name":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NormalizedIdentifier"},"schema_version":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"}},"required":["schema_name","schema_version"],"title":"SupportedSchemaVersion","type":"object"},"WorkDirectoryReference":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"An authorized root label plus a safe relative reference (plan 3.6).\n\nSpecification 11.3: the work directory is absolute in the launcher but\nserialized as an authorized root plus safe relative references. A nested\nvalue object, so it carries no envelope version.","properties":{"authorized_root":{"const":"RUNTIME_ROOT","title":"Authorized Root","type":"string"},"relative_path":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RelativeCandidatePath"}},"required":["authorized_root","relative_path"],"title":"WorkDirectoryReference","type":"object"}},"$id":"urn:crypto-lab:schema:protocol:adapter-command-request-envelope:1.0.0","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"command":{"const":"DESCRIBE"}},"required":["command"]},"then":{"properties":{"payload":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DescribeRequestPayload"},"timeout_seconds":{"maximum":300}}}},{"if":{"properties":{"command":{"const":"VALIDATE"}},"required":["command"]},"then":{"properties":{"payload":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EngineRunRequest"},"timeout_seconds":{"maximum":1800}}}},{"if":{"properties":{"command":{"const":"RUN"}},"required":["command"]},"then":{"properties":{"payload":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EngineRunRequest"},"timeout_seconds":{"maximum":604800}}}}],"description":"The temporary command-discriminated request wrapper (plan 3.6; spec 14.3).\n\nField order follows specification 11.3 (``schema_version`` first, the plan's\nresolution of the 14.3 listing). The header never carries the token: it is\ninside the ``EngineRunRequest`` payload exactly once and absent from a\ndescribe envelope. Trust class W, never persisted.","properties":{"command":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CommandKind"},"created_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime"},"deadline_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime"},"invocation_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/InvocationId"},"payload":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/DescribeRequestPayload"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/EngineRunRequest"}],"title":"Payload"},"payload_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"protocol_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Protocol Version","type":"string"},"request_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RequestId"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"},"timeout_seconds":{"maximum":604800,"minimum":1,"title":"Timeout Seconds","type":"integer"}},"required":["schema_version","protocol_version","request_id","invocation_id","command","created_at_utc","timeout_seconds","deadline_utc","payload_hash","payload"],"title":"AdapterCommandRequestEnvelope","type":"object"}
